  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "A black robed Gu Immortal appears behind Chanyu Zhong Er, who backs away to open some distance. The Gu Immortal stays where he is, aims his palm at Chanyu Zhong Er, and says that distance is enough for his soul suction Immortal Gu. Chanyu Zhong Er’s body stiffens and his soul shakes as if a huge force were pulling it out, and he knows ordinary defensive measures cannot stop such soul path methods. He steadies his soul and briefly holds the pull to a deadlock. Hei Cheng and Xue Song Zi put their arms on the Gu Immortal’s shoulders and join their souls to his, so that the Gu works like drawing in a river, a direct contest between souls, and Chanyu Zhong Er’s soul is pulled out. The black robed Gu Immortal holds the extracted soul, and Fairy Jiang Yu catches Chanyu Zhong Er’s falling body.",
